NOTICE
======

Third-Party Content Attribution
-------------------------------

The question banks for the following certifications include practice questions
imported from Cert Pro Quest (https://cert-pro-quest.lovable.app/), a practice
bank created by Matthew Purcell:

- CCAO-F (Claude Certified Associate — Foundations)
- CCAR-P (Claude Certified Architect — Professional)
- CCAR-F (Claude Certified Architect — Foundations)
- CCDV-F (Claude Developer Foundations) — 53 of the 175 items

Those imported items are community-created practice questions. They are NOT
official Anthropic exam content, are not endorsed by Anthropic, and no official
exam content is reproduced here.

The practice questions were imported for personal study use, with attribution
preserved on every imported item. Each imported question carries a source label
and URL pointing back to Cert Pro Quest. A versioned, local correction layer
(`scripts/lib/cpq-corrections.mjs`) records documented factual corrections to
specific items. It preserves source attribution and imported question IDs; it
is applied during bank generation and does not modify the raw source snapshot.

